li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three route tiers:</strong> Easy, medium, hard. Tougher orders give shorter deadlines but higher rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vertical playground:</strong> Jump from rooftop to rooftop on skyscrapers, through parks, beaches, and even flying cars.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Risk-versus-reward:</strong> Every collision is chaos - master the tilt to stay fluid, or faceplant and lose precious seconds.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speed-run ready:</strong> Tight five-minute loops and instant restarts, built for optimization addicts.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777690/extras/ee3e49a1950a0894cf53d2a432e47aa9.poster.avif?t=1753196436\" width=616 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777690/extras/ee3e49a1950a0894cf53d2a432e47aa9.webm?t=1753196436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777690/extras/ee3e49a1950a0894cf53d2a432e47aa9.mp4?t=1753196436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Goon Squad"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777690/d2b41548480d35703174eaa7cc7c34dfdfeb1a83/header.jpg?t=1753196436","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3777690/1171348250/172cb683f82499517c6180b0ec33fba8e1fd2da3/1751463764/dash_av1.mpd?t=1751900438","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3777690/1171348250/